---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+17035550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(703) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Gutter Repair in Woodbridge, VA | Fast Local Service" description="Expert gutter repair in Woodbridge, VA. Fix leaks, sagging sections, and damaged hangers. Same-day service available. Call (703) 555-0199.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → <a href="/#services">Services</a> → Gutter Repair</div>
      <h1>Gutter Repair in Woodbridge, VA</h1>
      <p>Fix leaks, sagging sections, and damaged hangers. We restore function without unnecessary full replacements.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <h2>Common Repairs We Handle</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Seam and joint sealing</li>
        <li>Hanger and spike replacement</li>
        <li>Section realignment and re-pitching</li>
        <li>End-cap and outlet repairs</li>
        <li>Minor hole patching</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>When Repair Makes Sense</h2>
      <p>If most of the system is sound and problems are localized, repair is the cost-effective choice. We give an honest assessment and never push a full replacement when a solid repair will restore years of service.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center">
        <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay} for Repair</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
